## SYSTEM OVERVIEW

RJ Business Solutions runs a **62-SOP autopilot system** across 7 phases,
3 AI agents, 239+ templates, 30 tracked legal changes for 2026.
Every build MUST integrate with this system.

Production API: https://rj-master-sop-2026.pages.dev/api
Tech Stack: Hono + Cloudflare Workers + D1 (SQLite) + Vite

## INTEGRATIONS (ALL ACTIVE)

### 1. MyFreeScoreNow (MFSN) — 3-Bureau Credit Reports
  API Base: https://api.myfreescorenow.com
  Spec: OpenAPI 3.0.3 — MFSN-REPORTS v1.0.0
  Auth: POST /api/auth/login (multipart/form-data: email, password) → tokens
  3B Fetch: POST /api/auth/fetch-3B-json (multipart/form-data: email, client_token)
  Response: { success, message, data: { providerViews: [{ provider: EFX|TU|EXP, summary, accounts, inquiries }] } }
  
  Our API Routes:
    POST /api/mfsn/login              → Authenticate with MFSN
    POST /api/mfsn/fetch-3b           → Pull 3B report + store in D1
      Body: { client_email, client_token, client_id? }
      Returns: { scores: {efx,tu,exp}, summary, report_id, stored }
    GET  /api/mfsn/reports/:clientId   → Get client's credit reports
    GET  /api/mfsn/score-history/:cId  → Score tracking over time
    GET  /api/mfsn/reports/:id/accounts → Accounts from a specific report
  
  D1 Tables: credit_reports, credit_report_accounts, credit_score_history
  Env Vars: MFSN_API_URL, MFSN_API_EMAIL, MFSN_API_PASSWORD

  MFSN Data Models (from API spec):
    CreditReportSummary: id, reportGenerated, reportType(US_3B|US_EFX), provider(EFX|TU|EXP),
      subject(PersonSubject), creditScore(CreditScore), revolvingAccounts, mortgageAccounts,
      installmentAccounts, otherAccounts, totalOpenAccounts, lengthOfCreditHistoryMonths,
      totalNegativeAccounts, averageAccountAgeMonths, oldestAccountOpenDate, totalInquires,
      totalPublicRecords, totalCollections, disputeInformation
    CreditReportAccount: provider, accountName, accountNumber, accountStatus(BANKRUPTCY_OR_WAGE_EARNER_PLAN|
      COLLECTION_OR_CHARGEOFF|FORECLOSURE|LATE_30_DAYS|LATE_60_DAYS|LATE_90_DAYS|PAYS_AS_AGREED|etc),
      accountOpen, loanType, balanceAmount(Money), creditLimitAmount, highCreditAmount, monthlyPayment,
      pastDueAmount, chargeOffAmount, trendedDataHistory, contactInformation, paymentHistory
    CreditScore: score(int), provider, scoreReasons[{code, description, creditScoreFactorEffect(HELPING|HURTING)}],
      scoreRange{minimum,maximum}, loanRiskRange{loanRiskMinimumScore,loanRiskMaximumScore}
    PersonSubject: currentName{firstName,lastName,middleName}, currentAddress, dateOfBirth,
      nationalIdentifier, homePhone, mobilePhone, aliases[PersonNameAlias], employers[Employer]
    PublicRecords: bankruptcies[], liens[], judgments[], consumerStatements[]
    PaymentHistory: years[{year, jan..dec: PaymentHistoryMonth{paymentStatus, scheduledAmount}}]

### 2. Twilio — SMS + Voice
  Account: AC4727a3fd6a8ce71a9b05d56fcc4b5b6c
  Phone: +18667524618
  
  Our API Routes:
    POST /api/twilio/sms   → Send SMS
      Body: { to, message, client_id?, template_name?, sop_id? }
    POST /api/twilio/call  → Initiate voice call
      Body: { to, twiml?, client_id?, sop_id? }
  
  Env Vars: TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER

### 3. Email — SendGrid + Resend (dual provider)
  From: support@rjbusinesssolutions.org
  
  Our API Routes:
    POST /api/email/sendgrid → Send via SendGrid
    POST /api/email/resend   → Send via Resend
      Body: { to, subject, html_body?, text_body?, client_id?, template_name?, sop_id? }
  
  Env Vars: SENDGRID_API_KEY, RESEND_API_KEY

### 4. Speed-to-Lead (Combo)
  POST /api/speed-to-lead → Auto-send SMS + Welcome Email on new lead
    Body: { client_id, first_name, phone, email }
    Maps to: SOP-304 (Speed-to-Lead), SOP-303 (Lead Gen)

### 5. Stripe — Payments
  Env Vars: STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY

### 6. Integration Health Check
  GET /api/integrations/status → Shows config status of all services

