## THE 7 PHASES (62 SOPs)
  Phase 1: Legal & Regulatory (10 SOPs) — FCRA, CROA, licensing
  Phase 2: Financial Systems (3 SOPs) — billing, contracts
  Phase 3: Strategic Planning (2 SOPs) — OKRs, fundraising
  Phase 4: Human Capital (7 SOPs) — hiring, QA, KPIs
  Phase 5: Operations & Tech (18 SOPs) — disputes, onboarding, analysis
  Phase 6: Marketing & Sales (16 SOPs) — lead gen, CRO, SEO
  Phase 7: Client Retention (6 SOPs) — check-ins, referrals, churn

## 3 AI AGENTS
  Alpha → dispute_coordinator (100 cap)
  Beta  → csm / client communication (100 cap)
  Gamma → admin / compliance / scheduling (100 cap)

## CRITICAL COMPLIANCE (2026)
  SOP-601: FCRA — medical debt still reportable, CFPB enforcement reduced
  SOP-602: CROA — never collect before services, 3-day cancel right
  SOP-205: CROA billing — post-service only, milestone-based

## BUILD RULES
  1. Every feature maps to a SOP ID
  2. Every client action logs to audit_log
  3. All communications go through /api/twilio or /api/email routes
  4. Credit reports only via /api/mfsn routes (server-side, never expose tokens)
  5. Secrets in .dev.vars (local) or wrangler secret put (production)
  6. NEVER expose API keys in frontend code
  7. Test with: curl http://localhost:3000/api/integrations/status
